    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'DWYER ARE EAGER TO BRING TO THE MARKET THIS WELL MAINTAINED 3 STOREY MID TERRACE OF MIXED USE. LOCATED IN THE HEART OF BAILIEBOROUGH TOWN CENTRE."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nReception - 5.4m x 3.8m\n\n\nOffice 1 - 2.8m x 2.3m\n\n\nHall - 4.7m x 2.0m\n\n\nOffice 2 - 2.5m x 2.0m\n\n\nKitchen - 4.4m x 2.4m\n\n\nWC - 2.1m x 2.1m\n\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.5m x 0.9m\n\n\nLanding/Hall - 2.0m x 0.8m\n\n\nSitting Room - 4.1m x 3.3m\n\n\nKitchen - 4.1m x 2.6m\n\n\nBathroom - 3.0m x 1.9m\n\n\nLanding - 2.8m x 2.0m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.0m x 2.9m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.0m x 2.3m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.0m x 2.6m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> We are delighted to present this charming period mid-terrace property located in the heart of a bustling town of Bailieborough</li><li> This mixed use premises comprises of a ground floor retail/office unit with separate 1st floor living accommodation</li><li> This well-maintained property boasts a generous 128 square of space over three levels.</li><li> The property exudes a perfect blend of historic charm and modern convenience, making it an ideal opportunity for investors or professionals seeking a fantastic investment.</li><li> To the rear the property has an enclose yard at ground floor with overlooking balcony space off upstairs apartment</li><li> This property also presents a fantastic investment opportunity for those looking to enter the commercial property market.</li><li> Oil Fired Central Heating</li><li> Mains Water</li><li> Mains Sewerage</li><li> Retail/Office Unit : c.50m²</li><li> Don't miss out on the chance to own this affordable and attractive property in a prime location.</li><li> Contact us today to arrange a viewing !</ul>"
      },
